  "details": "# Issue:\n\nOnly VRCSender1 has bloom when using the dolly camera multi-stream function.\n\n# Repro:\n\n1. Go to a world with heavy bloom (Treehouse in the Shade for example) with an avatar that has emissions.\n\n2. Open the Camera.\n\n3. Switch the Camera Mode to Stream.\n\n4. Go to the Dolly and add 4 different paths.\n\n5. Set Streaming to Multi.\n\n6. Play the Dolly.\n\n7. Observe that in OBS, only the first VRCSender has bloom applied.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nAll VRCSenders have identical post processing applied.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe video attached shows this in action with VRCSender1 in the main area and VRCSender2 in the left corner.",
